<title>UK: Pearson considering offers for Churchill.</title>
<headline>Pearson considering offers for Churchill.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pearson Plc is considering offers for its Churchill Livingstone medical publisher, chief executive Marjorie Scardino said on Monday.</p>
<p>She said Pearson was prepared to sell as part of its strategy of quitting activities in which it cannot be number one. Churchill Livingstone's products include Gray's Anatomy.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8793</p>
